.tag-on-time    { background: var(--color-success-bg); color: var(--color-success-fg); }
.tag-prequal    { background: rgba(74,74,244,0.12); color: var(--color-primary-700); }
.tag-zero-int   { background: var(--color-primary-500); color: #fff; }
```

**Navigation (Top bar)**
```css
